{"id": "34493", "title": "神气恶魔", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 46, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34493.htm", "intro": "她是写得一手好毛笔字，可这建商竹马竟推她去解决难搞客户？眼见大师挥毫都阵亡，嘿嘿，她就用油漆在墙上涂鸦──一去二三里，烟村四五家……不料“苦主”竟上门问罪，嫌她幼稚！呔，这人自做主张得很，仅只见一面，就知会一声都没有的把她左脸胎记偷走，害亲朋问她去哪整形，媒婆也纷拥而至，要他还来，他竟说害她老被取笑的胎记，是他为了寻找轮回后的她所做的记号！哇哩咧，见鬼了！是的，他坦承自己是鬼，而她渐渐发现他是只勾魂摄魄美丽的鬼，让她快乐的任他带她飞天遁地，旅行去，却没发现，她活不久了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34493", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2188545.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2188546.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2188547.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2188548.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2188549.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2188550.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2188551.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2188552.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2188553.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2188554.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2188555.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2188556.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2188557.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2188558.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2188559.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2188560.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2188561.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2188562.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2188563.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2188564.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2188565.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2188566.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2188567.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2188568.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "fil